MultiD4RT v0.5.0
https://github.com/bestzbf/MultiD4RT

MultiD4RT is this project's multi-camera 4D reconstruction and tracking
model. The implementation uses 4RC-derived and DINOv2-derived components.
Their original copyright, license and attribution notices remain intact.
This release does not replace them with a single repository-wide license.

